@startuml Complete System Architecture
!theme plain
skinparam backgroundColor #FEFEFE

title Study Studio - Document RAG System Architecture

package "Frontend" {
    [React/Next.js] as FE
}

package "Backend API\n(ASP.NET Core 8.0)" {
    package "Controllers" {
        [DocumentController] as DocCtrl
        [AIController] as AICtrl
    }
    
    package "Services" {
        [DocumentService] as DocSvc
        [AIService] as AISvc
        [GroqLLMService] as GroqSvc
        [GeminiEmbeddingService] as GeminiSvc
        [QdrantService] as QdrantSvc
        [BackblazeStorageService] as B2Svc
    }
    
    package "Repositories" {
        [GroupAttachmentRepository] as GARep
        [TaskRepository] as TRep
        [GroupParticipantRepository] as GPRep
    }
}

database "PostgreSQL" {
    [GroupAttachments] as GA_Table
    [Tasks] as Task_Table
    [Groups] as Group_Table
    [Users] as User_Table
}

cloud "External Services" {
    [Backblaze B2\nFile Storage] as B2
    [Qdrant Cloud\nVector Database] as Qdrant
    [Google Gemini\nEmbedding API] as Gemini
    [Groq\nLLM API] as Groq
}

' Frontend connections
FE --> DocCtrl: POST /api/documents/*
FE --> AICtrl: POST /api/ai/ask
FE --> B2: Direct upload/download\n(Presigned URLs)

' Controller -> Service
DocCtrl --> DocSvc
AICtrl --> AISvc

' Service -> Service
DocSvc --> B2Svc
DocSvc --> GeminiSvc
DocSvc --> QdrantSvc

AISvc --> GeminiSvc
AISvc --> QdrantSvc
AISvc --> GroqSvc

B2Svc --> B2
GeminiSvc --> Gemini
QdrantSvc --> Qdrant
GroqSvc --> Groq

' Service -> Repository
DocSvc --> GARep
DocSvc --> GPRep
AISvc --> TRep
AISvc --> GPRep

' Repository -> Database
GARep --> GA_Table
TRep --> Task_Table
GPRep --> Group_Table
GPRep --> User_Table

note right of B2
**File Storage**
- Presigned URLs
- Direct upload from FE
- S3-compatible API
end note

note right of Qdrant
**Vector Database**
- 768-dim vectors
- Cosine similarity
- Filter by groupId
- Metadata storage
end note

note right of Gemini
**Embedding Generation**
- Model: text-embedding-004
- 768 dimensions
- Batch processing
end note

note right of Groq
**LLM Inference**
- Model: llama-3.3-70b-versatile
- Temperature: 0.7
- Max tokens: 2000
end note

@enduml
